[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2643.109, "timestamp": "00:44:03", "text": "切。好了，我做到了。事情完成了。得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2645.99, "timestamp": "00:44:05", "text": "数组大小。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.069, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "尺寸信息在底部。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2667.51, "timestamp": "00:44:27", "text": "但愿它能奏效，伙计。我只是想要它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2681.27, "timestamp": "00:44:41", "text": "因此，重复流大小会逐渐增加。好的。环形"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2684.55, "timestamp": "00:44:44", "text": "并重复设置字符串变量字段。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2688.309, "timestamp": "00:44:48", "text": "是的，不是我插入的字段。好的。然后呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2691.43, "timestamp": "00:44:51", "text": "这是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2693.67, "timestamp": "00:44:53", "text": "转换变量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2696.87, "timestamp": "00:44:56", "text": "转换为JSON字符串。等等，什么？那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2699.27, "timestamp": "00:44:59", "text": "我该怎么做？"}]